FYI, I am still trying to wrap my head around this issue and how to best address it.

@klemenoslaj, have you verified that the fix you proposed in https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/36099 (which is similar to what is shown in the [blog post][2] you mentioned above) works for this usecase? AFAICT, it would only work if the redirection target allows cross-origin requests, which is not necessarily the case. What did I miss?

[2]: https://medium.com/@adactio/handling-redirects-with-a-service-worker-514a310863cf
